WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:06,430
You don't need to go there, I can do it

2
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,000
No one can be relied on for a lifetime

3
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:14,360
I have to adapt to this apocalypse as soon as possible

4
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:17,600
as you like

5
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:36,130
Wait for our brother

6
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:37,970
Are you sure this is for us to move?

7
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:39,610
Why don't you let the excavation plan come?

8
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:40,570
less nonsense

9
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:43,610
There is no excavation plan, just come on your own.

10
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:44,930
I am a professional bodyguard

11
00:00:45,210 --> 00:00:50,370
Now that I am part-time working as a moving company, can I leave? Of course, etc.
